---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Pendium"
  description="Pendium is a boutique AI implementation firm founded by Chris Wallace. We design AI assistants, knowledge management systems, and automation services for technology, media, and internet businesses."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="label label--accent">About</span>
      <h1 class="mt-16">The implementation layer<br/>between AI and your business.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider" />

  <section class="about-body">
    <div class="container about-body__inner">
      <div class="about-body__main">
        <div class="about-section">
          <span class="label">What we believe</span>
          <div class="about-text mt-24">
            <p>The gap between AI hype and AI value is an implementation problem. The technology is available to every company. What's rare is the judgment to deploy it well — to design systems that fit how teams actually work, that stay accurate over time, and that people actually use.</p>
            <p>Most AI rollouts fail at the handoff: the moment between "we built it" and "the team uses it." Pendium closes that gap.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <span class="label">How we work</span>
          <div class="about-text mt-24">
            <p>Pendium is a boutique practice. Every engagement is led by a senior practitioner — not handed off to a delivery team after the first call. Clients work directly with the person who designed the system.</p>
            <p>We operate as a high-trust partner, not a vendor. That means fewer clients, longer relationships, and work we're willing to put our name on.</p>
            <p>Specialist collaborators — in data engineering, design, and backend infrastructure — are brought in on engagements that require them. The core commitment stays the same: senior judgment on every decision.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
          <span class="label">What we build</span>
          <div class="about-text mt-24">
            <p><strong>AI assistants</strong> — designed as products with behavioral specification, escalation logic, and evaluation frameworks. Not chatbots bolted onto forms.</p>
            <p><strong>Knowledge management systems</strong> — RAG pipelines, vector databases, and search interfaces that make organizational knowledge findable, trustworthy, and AI-accessible. Designed with accuracy and governance from the start.</p>
            <p><strong>Design and tech automation</strong> — AI pipelines for creative and engineering workflows. We bridge design tools and engineering environments, building automation that teams actually adopt.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="about-body__sidebar">
        <div class="founder-card">
          <span class="label">Founder</span>
          <h3 class="mt-16">Chris Wallace</h3>
          <p class="mt-12">Designer, systems thinker, and AI practitioner with deep experience in AI assistant design, knowledge management architecture, and creative automation.</p>
          <p class="mt-12">Based in the US. Works with companies across North America and Europe.</p>
          <a href="mailto:hello@pendium.co" class="founder-card__email mt-24">hello@pendium.co</a>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-block">
          <span class="label">Engagement types</span>
          <ul class="sidebar-list mt-16">
            <li>
              <strong>Discovery Sprint</strong>
              <span>$8K–$15K · 2 weeks</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Project</strong>
              <span>$30K–$120K · 6–16 weeks</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Embedded Retainer</strong>
              <span>$8K–$25K/mo · ongoing</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Workshop</strong>
              <span>$3K–$8K · half or full day</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-block">
          <span class="label">Industries served</span>
          <ul class="sidebar-list mt-16">
            <li><span>Technology & SaaS</span></li>
            <li><span>Media & Publishing</span></li>
            <li><span>E-Commerce & Retail</span></li>
            <li><span>Marketing & Agencies</span></li>
            <li><span>Legal & Professional</span></li>
            <li><span>Financial Services</span></li>
            <li><span>Healthcare & HealthTech</span></li>
            <li><span>Education & EdTech</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider" />

  <section class="about-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="label">Work together</span>
      <h2 class="mt-16">Ready to get specific?</h2>
      <p class="mt-16">The Discovery Sprint is the lowest-commitment way to start. Two weeks, fixed price, clear output.</p>
      <div class="mt-32">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Start a conversation →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 80px);
    padding-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .about-body__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-section {
    padding-bottom: 64px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .about-section:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .about-text p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: none;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .about-text strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-body__sidebar {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 32px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .founder-card {
    padding: 32px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-card);
  }

  .founder-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .founder-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .founder-card__email {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--accent-1);
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }

  .founder-card__email:hover { opacity: 0.7; }

  .sidebar-block {
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .sidebar-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .sidebar-list li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .sidebar-list strong {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .sidebar-list span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .about-cta {
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    padding: 96px 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .about-body__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-body__sidebar {
      position: static;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .founder-card {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-body__sidebar {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
